{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa in Cooking School: Italian Food", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "It's All About Traditions", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Delicious Food > Italy", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "  Adverbs in Narratives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use special words in a specific order to talk about when something happened or will happen. These special words are called adverbs of time and sequence. They help the reader understand when things happen and in what order.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You often use these kinds of adverbs in narratives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " There are two categories of adverbs to talk about time and sequence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "1. Adverbs of time and sequence with two words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb + Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" by + time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> By eight o'clock, the restaurant was closed. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" at + time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> At around one o'clock, the students left the classroom. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" after + time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> After four o'clock, the employees go home. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" before + time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> John's parents arrived before noon. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" after + noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> After about fifteen minutes, I went back to the car. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" before + noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Before the show, we went out for a drink. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" during + noun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> During the play, people were on their phones. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>2. Adverbs of time and sequence with one word. <br/> You usually use these one word adverbs at the start of a sentence. They often have a comma after them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> First, John went into the kitchen.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Second\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Second, he opened the fridge door to grab a few items.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Third\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Third, he went to the cupboard to get a large mixing bowl.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Then\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Then, John found a large spoon on the counter.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Next\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Next, he proceeded to mix the ingredients together until the mixture was smooth.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Finally\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Finally, he poured the mixture into a frying pan on the stove.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First of all\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> First of all, John woke up at 7 a.m.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> After eating his breakfast, he went outside.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"After that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> After that, he drove to the mall. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to set off  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to begin traveling in a particular direction ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Marco Polo set off to sail the seas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you can use in a short story.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "century  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of 100 years", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He explored the world in the thirteenth century.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "maiden  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a young girl or woman who is not married ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He saw a lovely Chinese maiden.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to stare  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to look at someone or something for a long time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They stared at each other for hours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to overflow ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to flow over the edge or top of something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The dough was overflowing the bowl.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to drip   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to fall in drops", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The dough was dripping everywhere.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to serve  ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give food or drink to someone at a meal ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The cooks served the spaghetti to the sailors.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le04ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a short narrative (3 paragraphs) taking into account the items mentioned in the previous activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Add adverbs of sequence and time like <span class=\"italic\">first</span>, <span class=\"italic\">next</span> and <span class=\"italic\">after</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use adjectives to make your story more interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your story aloud to a friend or family member.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a short narrative in three paragraphs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I express the order of events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use descriptive words to make the story interesting.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "static", "contents": [{"value": "", "type": "img"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "picture"}, {"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "5000", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Narratives - What do you need to include?</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "56000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">The steps to writing a short narrative</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn4le04ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn4le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "10", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">How Spaghetti Came to Italy</span></p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "3000", "id": 2, "text": "Marco Polo set off to sail the seas and explore the world in the thirteenth century. He was the first European to ever reach China. There, he saw many beautiful sights. The most beautiful was a lovely Chinese maiden. He knew he had to spend as much time as possible with her.  He immediately fell in love with the woman, and she felt the same way.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob08re2img02.jpg", "time": "29500", "id": 3, "text": "One hot, sunny afternoon, Marco was sitting with his love while she was baking bread. During this time, they stared at each other for so long that the maiden didn't realize the dough was overflowing and dripping over the side of the bowl.  The hot sun quickly dried up the dough into long, hard strings.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "52000", "id": 4, "text": "Marco didn't want his love to be embarrassed, so he took the strings back to the ship, where the cook boiled them and served them to the crew for supper. The strings were such a hit that when the ship returned to Italy, the sailors told everyone that they must try them.</p>"}, {"image": "engenn4le04ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "70000", "id": 5, "text": "After that, cooks on other ships decided to serve the strings as well.  It soon became one of Italy's favorite foods."}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le04ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le04ob08re2img03.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 3}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can write about traditions.</br>", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write a short narrative.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What kind of short stories do you like reading ?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What makes a good short story?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask a partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: Let me tell you a story ...", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Narrator", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_dat